    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37545" root="لج" body-key="l">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لجّج</span></b> , (inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَلْجِيجٌ</span>, K,) <i>It</i> (a ship, S)
<i>entered the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُجَّة</span> [or <i>main sea,</i> or <i>the fathomless
deep,</i> or <i>the great expanse of sea of which the
limits could not be seen</i>]. (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَجُّوا</span> [perhaps a mistake for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَلَجُّوا</span>] <i>They entered the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُجّ</span>
[or <i>main sea, &amp;c.</i>]. (A, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَلَجُّوا</span></b>  and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَجَّجُوا</span> <i>They embarked upon the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لجة</span> [or <i>main
sea, &amp;c.</i>]. (TA.)

